===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ine-pro|la}} {{m|ine-pro|*tóm}}, accusative of {{m|ine-pro|*só}}. Confer with its feminine form {{etyl|la|-}} {{m|la|tam}}, as in {{m|la|cum}}-{{m|la|quam}}, {{m|la|num}}-{{m|la|nam}}.

===Pronunciation===
